            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RCS338, Cabinet Door Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSmall surface mounted roller catch for use on cabinet doors or similar light weight doors. The Cabinet Door Roller Catch is surface mounted making it easy to install. Both the roller catch and strike plate are slotted for clearance adjustments. Packaged with strike plate and mounting screws. Available in polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, or satin nickel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-RCS3380-size.gif?v=1704354776\" width=\"567\" height=\"166\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana RCS338 Roller Catch Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana RCS338 Roller Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RCS3380.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana RCS338 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
